{
    "title": "Popular Words: Family Game",
    "description": "A new simple and fun word game emerges as a word trivia family game! Test your general knowledge, vocabulary, intelligence, and ingenuity with a relaxing design and gameplay. \r\n\r\nIf you are a word game fan, try this challenge, take the quizzes, and discover Popular Words. Find out the most popular answers to short everyday questions in life. Hours and hours of fun are guaranteed with this simple and addictive word trivia game! Get everyone's heads up in your family and ready to play this engaging family game of guessing words to fill in the blanks.\r\n\r\nYour awareness of your daily routine will also increase with games for family. Additionally, researchers have found that adults who regularly solved word puzzles and trivia games requiring familiarity with a more extensive vocabulary might have better brain function later in life.\r\n\r\nPopular Words is inspired by the TV shows such as America Says, Family Feud, and Jeopardy. You have to guess what most people say to certain questions. Each level presents a fill-in-the-blank question and five possible answers. There would be several correct answers, but you have to find the most common 5 of them whose first letters are shown to give players a hint. Blank length indicates the length of the correct word. If you like headbands games, people games and guess the word games you will enjoy this fun word trivia game too.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\u2022 Hundreds of unique questions, thousands of word challenges. \r\n\u2022 Free Daily challenges and bonus rewards.\r\n\u2022 Simple & easy to play. Autocorrect system to help players in typing the answers.\r\n\u2022 Level list to allow players to gain rewards for the completed chapters. \r\n\u2022 Leaderboards to compete with others.\r\n\u2022 Completely free to play word trivia. Guess up now!\r\n\u2022 Boost brain functions and improve memory.\r\n\u2022 Train your brain with addicting trivia games free to play.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy fun family games and show games with family and friends.\r\n\u2022 Test your knowledge and enjoy hours of entertainment with this trivia quiz game for the whole family.\r\n \r\nGather your family and friends to play this word party game and recreate the popular TV shows in your house. Make the social gatherings exciting again! If you enjoy trivia quiz games and show games, bring your friends together and guess their answers in this fun trivia game for free.\r\n\r\nPopular Words is developed by the creators of fan-favorite word games such as Word Pearls and Brain Test. Enjoy the next iteration of our rapidly expanding word game library. \r\n\r\nDownload for free now and start playing to have limitless fun, improve your knowledge, enhance your brain functions and discover yourself.",
    "descriptionHTML": "A new simple and fun word game emerges as a word trivia family game! Test your general knowledge, vocabulary, intelligence, and ingenuity with a relaxing design and gameplay. <br><br>If you are a word game fan, try this challenge, take the quizzes, and discover Popular Words. Find out the most popular answers to short everyday questions in life. Hours and hours of fun are guaranteed with this simple and addictive word trivia game! Get everyone&#39;s heads up in your family and ready to play this engaging family game of guessing words to fill in the blanks.<br><br>Your awareness of your daily routine will also increase with games for family. Additionally, researchers have found that adults who regularly solved word puzzles and trivia games requiring familiarity with a more extensive vocabulary might have better brain function later in life.<br><br>Popular Words is inspired by the TV shows such as America Says, Family Feud, and Jeopardy. You have to guess what most people say to certain questions. Each level presents a fill-in-the-blank question and five possible answers. There would be several correct answers, but you have to find the most common 5 of them whose first letters are shown to give players a hint. Blank length indicates the length of the correct word. If you like headbands games, people games and guess the word games you will enjoy this fun word trivia game too.<br><br>FEATURES<br>\u2022 Hundreds of unique questions, thousands of word challenges. <br>\u2022 Free Daily challenges and bonus rewards.<br>\u2022 Simple &amp; easy to play. Autocorrect system to help players in typing the answers.<br>\u2022 Level list to allow players to gain rewards for the completed chapters. <br>\u2022 Leaderboards to compete with others.<br>\u2022 Completely free to play word trivia. Guess up now!<br>\u2022 Boost brain functions and improve memory.<br>\u2022 Train your brain with addicting trivia games free to play.<br>\u2022 Enjoy fun family games and show games with family and friends.<br>\u2022 Test your knowledge and enjoy hours of entertainment with this trivia quiz game for the whole family.<br> <br>Gather your family and friends to play this word party game and recreate the popular TV shows in your house. Make the social gatherings exciting again! If you enjoy trivia quiz games and show games, bring your friends together and guess their answers in this fun trivia game for free.<br><br>Popular Words is developed by the creators of fan-favorite word games such as Word Pearls and Brain Test. Enjoy the next iteration of our rapidly expanding word game library. <br><br>Download for free now and start playing to have limitless fun, improve your knowledge, enhance your brain functions and discover yourself.",
